{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonbyfoot/items/393818/", "pk": 393818, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonbyfoot/", "pk": 79348, "shortname": "bostonbyfoot", "name": "Boston By Foot", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Private Tour: Beacon Hill", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 1, "unicode": "Private Tour: Beacon Hill", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": true, "sold_out_text": "SOLD OUT!", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 168.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": false, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 168.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": false, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": true, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 48500, "description": "*From April to mid-November, Private tours are bookable online for groups of up to 20 people with at least 1 week's notice. To request a private tour for groups of more than 20 people, or in the fall/winter, use the Private Tour Request form. Please provide at least 1-2 weeks notice in advance of your preferred tour date for larger groups.*\n\n[Private tour request form link](https://form.jotform.com/220595239082054)\n\n## Duration, Distance, Terrain\n1.5 hours\n1 mile at a moderate pace, stopping at various sites along the tour\n## About\nExplore the connection between architecture and politics in this tour along the charming streets of Beacon Hill's South Slope.\n\nLearn how Boston’s elite created an exclusive neighborhood next to the site of the state capital. \n\nExperience Beacon Hill’s past as you hear stories of independent female investor Hepzibah Swan; the fight for social justice at the Charles Street Meeting House; and the early American architecture of Charles Bulfinch.  \n\nWalk through this historic collection of Federal and Greek Revival row homes on the shaded streets of Beacon Hill.\n\nAfter the tour, enjoy dinner or lunch at a charming restaurant along Charles Street. \n\nUncover even more stories of Beacon Hill with our select offering of Beacon Hill tours!\n\n## Meeting location:\nMeet your guide in front of the Massachusetts State House steps on Beacon Street, Boston (across from Boston Common).\n\nFinding Your Guide: All guides carry an 8×11 sign that says “Boston By Foot Walking Tours.”\n\nNearest MBTA Station: Park Street (Red & Green Lines) \n## What to bring\nComfortable shoes, dress for the weather, water bottle", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "PLEASE NOTE: If the State House steps are unavailable due to construction or other Activities, meet your guide across the street in front of the Shaw and 54th Regiment Memorial on Beacon Street.", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Walk past the stunning Federal and Greek Revival row homes • 1.5 Hours", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonbyfoot/items/393818/images/789268/", "pk": 789268, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/a9BOC0VNQh29m50M1JlP", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/a9BOC0VNQh29m50M1JlP", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonbyfoot/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bostonbyfoot/items/393818/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/a9BOC0VNQh2